  "description": "In the waning age of magic there lived \"Tethys\", the royal court sorcerer of the Belga Kingdom, and \"Dima\", a skilled wand craftsman.\nWhile Dima never hid his affection, Tethys always met it with a teasing smile.\nOne day, a prodigiously powerful young sorcerer named \"Enya\" appeared in the kingdom. Fate would one day bind \"Tethys\" to \"Enya\"—through a wand crafted by \"Dima\"’s own hands.\nThis is the story of three, set in the Velga Kingdom, built upon the cliffs where the waves crash below.",
